 "schemes.personalAccessToken.description: \"Flexmail authenticates your API requests using the HTTP [Basic authentication](https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc7617) scheme with your account ID as the _username_ and a personal access token as the _password_.\\n\\nPersonal access tokens can be managed in the Flexmail application via `Settings > API > Personal access tokens`\\n\\nExample of an authenticated API request using `curl`:\\n```shell script\\ncurl -u <account_id>:<personal_access_token> -i -X GET https://api.flexmail.eu\\n```\\n&nbsp;\"",
